  // Each record owns the fame tiers for all members of an existing product group.
  // product_group names the existing group without "@". Each optional reputation, brand or
  // challenge block uses the same threshold, trigger, min_quality and reward as a product tier.
  // An unwritten tier id defaults to <fame group id>_challenge; an explicit id can be referenced
  // by specializations and recipes. Mods can add, override or blacklist fame_groups by id.
  // Explicit reputation and brand ids below retain their original serialized identities.
